#: src/main.glade:122
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks "
"to the camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps ("
"or in daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to kee"
"p unlocking reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Slegs een gesigmodel is ingeskryf. Beligting verander hoe jou gesig vi"
"r die kamera lyk, so 'n enkele model kan saans onder lampe (of in dagl"
"ig) misluk. Voeg 'n tweede model by wat in ander lig aangeteken is om "
"die ontsluiting betroubaar te hou op enige tyd van die dag."

