#: src/main.glade:448
msgid ""
"A desktop notification shows while Ubuntu Hello looks for your face, t"
"hen reports the result. Failed attempts stay in the notification list."
msgstr ""
"'n Werkskermkennisgewing wys terwyl Ubuntu Hello na jou gesig soek, en"
" rapporteer dan die resultaat. Mislukte pogings bly in die kennisgewin"
"glys."

#: src/main.glade:475
msgid "Show notifications"
msgstr "Wys kennisgewings"

#: src/main.glade:483
msgid ""
"One card per face-authentication attempt, updated in place with the re"
"sult."
msgstr "Een kaart per gesigstawingpoging, opgedateer in plek met die resultaat."

#: src/main.glade:530
