msgstr "Kennisgewing klink"

#: src/main.glade:538
msgid "Play the system sound for a recognized or failed attempt."
msgstr "Speel die stelselklank vir 'n herkende of mislukte poging."

#: src/main.glade:585
msgid "Include diagnostics"
msgstr "Sluit diagnostiek in"

#: src/main.glade:593
msgid ""
"Add the model, certainty vs. threshold, frames, camera and timing to e"
"ach card. Useful when reporting a problem."
msgstr ""
"Voeg die model, sekerheid teenoor drempel, rame, kamera en tydsbereken"
"ing by elke kaart. Nuttig wanneer 'n probleem gerapporteer word."

#: src/main.glade:655 src/onboarding.glade:116
msgid "Keyring / KWallet Auto-Unlock"
msgstr "Sleutelring / KWallet Outo-ontsluit"

#: src/main.glade:672
msgid ""
"Enable face authentication to automatically unlock your login keyring "
"or KWallet on login. This securely stores your password sealed in the "
"TPM when available, or encrypted with AES-256-GCM using a root-only ma"
"ster key. Face auth sets PAM_AUTHTOK for pam_gnome_keyring or pam_kwal"
"let5 depending on your desktop."
msgstr ""
"Aktiveer gesigstawing om outomaties jou aanmeldsleutelring of KWallet "
"by aanmelding te ontsluit. Dit stoor jou wagwoord veilig verseël in di"
"e TPM wanneer dit beskikbaar is, of geïnkripteer met AES-256-GCM met '"
"n wortel-alleen-hoofsleutel. Gesigsauthoring stel PAM_AUTHTOK vir pam_"
"gnome_keyring of pam_kwallet5, afhangende van jou rekenaar."

